          <td><span class="postbody">Websites:
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.thottbot.com/" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.thottbot.com/</a>  - Only database you'll need for Quests, Weapons, Armor, Classes, Proffesions....
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.ultimategamers.com/worldofwarcraft/trainers.html" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.ultimategamers.com/worldofwarcraft/trainers.html</a>  - List of trainer locations.
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.worldofwar.net/cartography/worldmap/kalimdorcont.php" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.worldofwar.net/cartography/worldmap/kalimdorcont.php</a> Kalmidor map
<br />

<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.worldofwar.net/cartography/worldmap/easterncont.php" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.worldofwar.net/cartography/worldmap/easterncont.php</a> Eastern Kingdoms map
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.goblinworkshop.com/" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.goblinworkshop.com/</a> Another database one
<br />

<br />

<br />
Mods:
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://wow.jaslaughter.com/" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://wow.jaslaughter.com/</a> Minigroup and Bank Items 
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=2435" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=2435</a> Move Anything - (I used it to move the channeling bar)
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=860" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=860</a> Titan Panel  ( shows info like bag usage, location , xp rate...all on a windows like taskbar that can be on top or bottom or both)
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=539" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=539</a> Atlas  ( in game map guide for instances )
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=44" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=44</a> Gatherer ( spawn point rememberer for herbs, mines, treasure chests, etc )
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=343" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=343</a> Monkey Quest ( better quest list than ingame...)
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=515" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=515</a> Monkey Buddy ( to configure monkey quest )
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=769" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php?addid=769</a> Quest Level
<br />

<br />
Also might lookup Recap , Simpletip , LS_Chat and Quickloot at <a href="http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.curse-gaming.com/mod.php</a></span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
