          <td><span class="postbody">Since we're tralking mods...
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Titan Panel [Guild]</span>
<br />
Once we have a guild formed (or if at all) this is an IM style mod I wrote for Titan Panel to allow easier communication with Guild mates.
<br />
<a href="http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=801" target="_blank">http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=801</a>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Titan Panel [Recap]</span>
<br />
It's the Titan Plugin for the Recap damage meter addon. I've also maintain this one.
<br />
<a href="http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=1125" target="_blank">http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=1125</a>
<br />
Recap is <a href="http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=859" target="_blank">http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=859</a>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">RogueTracker</span>
<br />
Still somewhat beta, but it works with some tinkering
<br />
<a href="http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=1340" target="_blank">http://ui.worldofwar.net/ui.php?id=1340</a>
<br />
Track rogue stuff like blind powder, flash powder and apply poisions easy. If you've used "shardtracker" it's alot like that.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
